{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01669",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 6.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.51,
      "end_seconds": 14.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.65,
      "end_seconds": 34.98,
      "duration_seconds": 20.33,
      "text": "Let me think, you know, it's a sore on my ankle that won't heal. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.36,
      "end_seconds": 38.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.95,
      "end_seconds": 46.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "About four days, I think... sorry, ten days, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.77,
      "end_seconds": 50.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.37,
      "end_seconds": 80.23,
      "duration_seconds": 25.86,
      "text": "It usually comes with aching legs. Right, and there's swollen legs by evening as well, five days now. About swollen legs by evening, it's worse with standing. The aching legs? That's been for about four days. About aching legs, I'd give it a seven, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.96,
      "end_seconds": 85.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.05,
      "end_seconds": 100.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.09,
      "end_seconds": 120.97,
      "duration_seconds": 10.88,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, respiratory rate 15, heart rate 86, temperature is 36.6 degrees, BP is 112 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.05,
      "end_seconds": 124.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.54,
      "end_seconds": 128.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.12,
      "end_seconds": 134.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.68,
      "end_seconds": 138.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Yes, um, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.8,
      "end_seconds": 141.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.21,
      "end_seconds": 167.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "There is a shallow ulcer above the inner ankle with brown skin around it and visible varicose veins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.35,
      "end_seconds": 174.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "You can sit up now. What about calf pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.53,
      "end_seconds": 178.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No. No calf pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.99,
      "end_seconds": 184.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain, fever or spreading redness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.4,
      "end_seconds": 192.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain, fever or spreading redness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.76,
      "end_seconds": 198.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.28,
      "end_seconds": 201.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.55,
      "end_seconds": 205.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.35,
      "end_seconds": 211.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.9,
      "end_seconds": 228.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.69,
      "end_seconds": 232.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.35,
      "end_seconds": 239.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.65,
      "end_seconds": 244.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.9,
      "end_seconds": 249.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.34,
      "end_seconds": 256.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "I take Foracort inhaler, twice a day for my asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.67,
      "end_seconds": 262.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.71,
      "end_seconds": 268.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "I have gout, for about a year. Yes, asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.75,
      "end_seconds": 275.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Yes, asthma is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.78,
      "end_seconds": 292.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.26,
      "end_seconds": 305.18,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.02,
      "end_seconds": 354.79,
      "duration_seconds": 37.77,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards a venous leg ulcer. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. We shouldn't forget an arterial ulcer. I want a doppler test of the leg pulses done, that's for leg ulcer. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I think a wound swab makes sense here, for leg ulcer. Compression bandaging and keeping the leg raised when sitting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.7,
      "end_seconds": 383.82,
      "duration_seconds": 23.12,
      "text": "Let's get you seen by the leg ulcer clinic, I'll arrange the letter. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. See me again in two weeks. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.53,
      "end_seconds": 389.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.9,
      "end_seconds": 395.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.84,
      "end_seconds": 402.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Erm, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}